<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 0.28 points off UK's FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 0.28 points off UK's FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International Ltd said the following FTSE 100 index stock will go ex-dividend on Monday and the effect will be to take 0.28 points off the index today.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>    * Pearson			 6.90  8.63   0.282</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
